00:07:40.320 --> 00:07:45.870
the plagiarism checkers, which usually check
some kind of engram overlap, you can pretty

00:07:45.870 --> 00:07:49.270
easily obtain things like this doing reverse
translation.

00:07:49.270 --> 00:07:53.630
So what you do is you translate from English
to some language and then translate back.

00:07:53.630 --> 00:07:57.970
And usually if you set the temperature parameter
